<title>UK: Wet Brent trades lower at April -64 cents - trade.</title>
<headline>Wet Brent trades lower at April -64 cents - trade.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>A cargo of Brent Blend crude was traded slightly lower at a 64 cent discount to April Brent on the North Sea spot market on Thursday, traders said.</p>
<p>The March 25-27 loader changed hands at four cents under a cargo loading March 22-24 that was sold at April -60 cents on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Another cargo loading March 25-27 went at April -50 cents, also on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom, +44 171 542 7646</p>
</text>
